        "title": "Advance Tax - Save Money, Pay Tax on Time (Part 3)",
        "content": "Now, pay Rs.55,000 in installments:\nJune 15: 15% of Rs.55,000 = Rs.8,250\nSeptember 15: 30% of Rs.55,000 = Rs.16,500\nDecember 15: 30% of Rs.55,000 = Rs.16,500\nMarch 15: 25% of Rs.55,000 = Rs.13,750\n```\n\n### Real Example: Freelancer Earning Rs.8 Lakh Quarterly\n\n**Sha's Advance Tax Calculation:**\n\n```\nSHA CONTENT CREATIONS\nFY 2025-26 Estimated Income:\n\nQuarter 1 (Apr-Jun): Rs.2,00,000\nQuarter 2 (Jul-Sep): Rs.2,00,000\nQuarter 3 (Oct-Dec): Rs.2,00,000\nQuarter 4 (Jan-Mar): Rs.2,00,000\nTotal: Rs.8,00,000\n\nDeductions:\nSection 80C (ELSS): Rs.1,50,000\nSection 80D (Health Insurance): Rs.25,000\nSection 80CCD(1B) (NPS): Rs.50,000\nTotal Deductions: Rs.2,25,000\n\nTaxable Income: Rs.8,00,000 - Rs.2,25,000 = Rs.5,75,000\n\nTax Calculation (New Regime):\n0-Rs.3,00,000: NIL\nRs.3,00,001-Rs.5,75,000: 5% of Rs.2,75,000 = Rs.13,750\nCess: 4% of Rs.13,750 = Rs.550\nTotal Tax: Rs.14,300\n\nTDS Deducted: Rs.8,000\nAdvance Tax Payable: Rs.14,300 - Rs.8,000 = Rs.6,300\n\nINSTALLMENT SCHEDULE:\nJune 15: 15% of Rs.6,300 = Rs.945\nSeptember 15: 30% of Rs.6,300 = Rs.1,890\nDecember 15: 30% of Rs.6,300 = Rs.1,890\nMarch 15: 25% of Rs.6,300 = Rs.1,575\nTotal: Rs.6,300\n```\n\n**Simple, right?** Sha estimates quarterly income, applies deductions, calculates tax, and pays installments!\n\n---",
