        "content": "Expense deductions are Gold for freelancers! In Module 10 we covered basic deductions, now let us detail the many expenses that are deductible for freelancers.\n\n### Complete List of Deductible Expenses\n\n| Expense Category | Deductible? | How Much | Documentation Needed |\n|-----------------|-------------|----------|---------------------|\n| **Home Office** | | | |\n| Rent (proportional) | Yes | Based on space % | Rent receipts, Agreement |\n| Electricity (proportional) | Yes | Based on usage % | Electricity bills |\n| Internet (proportional) | Yes | Based on usage % | Internet bills |\n| **Equipment** | | | |\n| Laptop/Desktop | Yes | Depreciation 40% | Purchase invoice |\n| Phone | Yes | Depreciation 40% | Purchase invoice |\n| Camera | Yes | Depreciation 40% | Purchase invoice |\n| Furniture | Yes | Depreciation 10% | Purchase invoice |\n| **Software** | | | |\n| Adobe CC | Yes | 100% | Subscription receipt |\n| Microsoft 365 | Yes | 100% | Subscription receipt |\n| Other Tools | Yes | 100% | Subscription receipt |\n| **Professional** | | | |\n| Courses/Training | Yes | 100% | Course receipt |\n| Books/Publications | Yes | 100% | Purchase receipt |\n| Professional Memberships | Yes | 100% | Membership receipt |\n| **Marketing** | | | |\n| Website Hosting | Yes | 100% | Hosting receipt |\n| Domain Name | Yes | 100% | Purchase receipt |\n| Advertising | Yes | 100% | Ad receipts |\n| **Operations** | | | |\n| Co-working Space | Yes | 100% | Rent receipts |\n| Travel (Client Meetings) | Yes | 100% | Travel tickets, Bills |\n| Phone Bills | Yes | Proportional | Phone bills |\n| Office Supplies | Yes | 100% | Purchase receipts |\n| **Financial** | | | |\n| Bank Charges | Yes | 100% | Bank statement |\n| CA Fees | Yes | 100% | CA invoice |\n| Professional Tax | Yes | 100% | Payment receipt |\n\n### How to Maintain Expense Records\n\n**Rule #1: Keep receipts for every expense**\n- Digital receipts are valid\n- Bank statements as backup\n- Photograph physical receipts",
