        "content": "Depreciation Calculation:\nArea percentage: 120/900 = 13.33%\n\nMonthly Expenses:\nRent: Rs.20,000 x 13.33% = Rs.2,666\nElectricity: Rs.2,500 x 13.33% = Rs.333\nInternet: Rs.1,000 x 100% = Rs.1,000 (fully business)\nWater: Rs.400 x 13.33% = Rs.53\n\nAnnual Deduction:\n(Rs.2,666 + Rs.333 + Rs.1,000 + Rs.53) x 12 = Rs.47,988\n\nMeera saved Rs.14,396 in taxes (at 30% slab)!\n```\n\n### Software Subscription Deductions - Complete List\n\n| Software | Annual Cost | GST | Total Deduction | Best For |\n|----------|-------------|-----|-----------------|----------|\n| Adobe Creative Cloud | Rs.60,000 | Rs.10,800 | Rs.70,800 | Designers |\n| Microsoft 365 | Rs.8,000 | Rs.1,440 | Rs.9,440 | All Freelancers |\n| Grammarly Premium | Rs.10,000 | Rs.1,800 | Rs.11,800 | Writers |\n| Canva Pro | Rs.5,000 | Rs.900 | Rs.5,900 | Designers |\n| Zoom Pro | Rs.15,000 | Rs.2,700 | Rs.17,700 | Consultants |\n| Notion | Rs.3,000 | Rs.540 | Rs.3,540 | Project Management |\n| Slack | Rs.6,000 | Rs.1,080 | Rs.7,080 | Team Communication |\n| Trello | Rs.4,000 | Rs.720 | Rs.4,720 | Project Management |\n| Hostinger | Rs.5,000 | Rs.900 | Rs.5,900 | Website Hosting |\n| Domain (GoDaddy) | Rs.1,000 | Rs.180 | Rs.1,180 | Website |\n\n**Total Software Deduction Potential: Rs.1,20,000+ per year!**\n\n**Amit's Software Stack:**\n```\nAmit uses:\n- Adobe CC: Rs.60,000\n- Microsoft 365: Rs.8,000\n- Figma (Professional): Rs.12,000\n- Slack: Rs.6,000\n- Notion: Rs.3,000\n- Google Workspace: Rs.8,000\n- Canva Pro: Rs.5,000\n\nTotal: Rs.1,02,000 + GST Rs.18,360 = Rs.1,20,360\nFull deduction claimed: Rs.1,20,360\nTax saved at 20%: Rs.24,072\n```\n\n### Professional Development Deductions\n\nFull deduction is available for courses and certifications - this is an investment in your skills!\n\n| Course/Certification | Cost | Deductible? | Tax Benefit |\n|---------------------|------|-------------|-------------|\n| Online Writing Course | Rs.15,000 | Yes | Full |\n| Design Certification | Rs.25,000 | Yes | Full |\n| Marketing Course | Rs.20,000 | Yes | Full |\n| Coding Bootcamp | Rs.50,000 | Yes | Full |\n| Language Course | Rs.10,000 | Yes | Full |",
