        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "TDS Claiming and Refund Process - How to Get Money Back (Part 2)",
        "content": "**Kunal's Refund Problem:**\nKunal filed ITR, but refund did not come for 6 months. Reason: He did not verify ITR! After verification, refund came in 2 weeks. Lesson: Always verify ITR within 30 days!\n\n### Real Example: Rs.50,000 TDS Deducted\n\n**Aman's Complete TDS Refund Calculation:**\n\n```\nAMAN WEB DEVELOPMENT\nFY 2025-26\n\nCLIENT PAYMENTS:\nClient A: Rs.2,00,000 (TDS: Rs.20,000)\nClient B: Rs.1,50,000 (TDS: Rs.15,000)\nClient C: Rs.1,00,000 (TDS: Rs.10,000)\nPlatform: Rs.50,000 (TDS: Rs.5,000)\nTotal Income: Rs.5,00,000\nTotal TDS: Rs.50,000\n\nTAX CALCULATION (44ADA):\nGross Receipts: Rs.5,00,000\n50% Deduction: Rs.2,50,000\nTaxable Income: Rs.2,50,000\n\nTax (New Regime):\nUp to Rs.3L: NIL\nTax: Rs.0\nCess: Rs.0\nTotal Tax: Rs.0\n\nTax Liability: Rs.0\nTDS DEDUCTED: Rs.50,000\nREFUND: Rs.50,000!\n\nAman gets full Rs.50,000 back!\n```\n\n**Aman's Smart Move:** Aman invests his TDS refund every year in ELSS. In 5 years, Rs.2.5 lakh refund + 12% returns = Rs.3.75 lakh! Money makes money!\n\n### TDS on Different Types of Freelance Income\n\nDifferent types of income have different TDS rules. Understand them so there are no surprises!\n\n**Detailed TDS Rate Chart:**\n\n| Section | Nature of Payment | TDS Rate | Threshold (Single) | Threshold (Annual) | When to Deduct |\n|---------|-------------------|----------|--------------------|--------------------|----------------|\n| 194C | Contract Work (Individual) | 1% | Rs.30,000 | Rs.1,00,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194C | Contract Work (Others) | 2% | Rs.30,000 | Rs.1,00,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194J | Professional Services | 10% | Rs.30,000 | Rs.30,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194J | Technical Services | 2% | Rs.30,000 | Rs.30,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194H | Commission/Brokerage | 5% | Rs.15,000 | Rs.15,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194I(a) | Plant & Machinery Rent | 2% | Rs.2,40,000 | Rs.2,40,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194I(b) | Land/Building Rent | 10% | Rs.2,40,000 | Rs.2,40,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |\n| 194A | Interest (Other than Bank) | 10% | Rs.40,000 | Rs.40,000 | Payment Credit/Entry |",
        "color": "#10B981",
        "emoji": "💻",
        "interactiveType": "no"
