        "content": "Professional tax is small but important. If you are providing professional services in any state, you have to pay it!\n\n### What is Professional Tax?\n\nProfessional tax is a state government tax levied on professionals, traders, and employees. It is different from income tax and rates vary by state.\n\n### Which States Charge Professional Tax\n\n| State | Professional Tax? | Monthly Rate Range |\n|-------|-------------------|-------------------|\n| Maharashtra | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| Gujarat | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| Karnataka | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| Tamil Nadu | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| Andhra Pradesh | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| West Bengal | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| Madhya Pradesh | Yes | Rs.200 - Rs.2,500 |\n| Delhi | No | - |\n| Uttar Pradesh | No | - |\n| Rajasthan | No | - |\n| Punjab | No | - |\n| Haryana | No | - |\n\n**Note:** 20+ states charge professional tax. Check your state's rules!\n\n### Rates and Slabs",
